  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "43d2252f03d25d03",
      "translationZh": "Galaxy Unpacked 2026 上的 3 项 Google 更新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "866c619f34bcf156",
      "translationZh": "在 Galaxy Unpacked 上，我们分享了 Samsung 用户如何通过即将推出的新款折叠屏设备、手表和眼镜提升生产力、节省时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c368b7bf55b57df2",
      "translationZh": "Android 生态系统营销副总裁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc315285c5c4c76f",
      "translationZh": "Google 推出了搭载 Gemini Intelligence 的全新 Samsung Galaxy Z Fold8 和 Flip8 系列，可在 40 款热门应用中自动执行日常任务。现在，您可以在这些设备上使用 Gemini Notebook，综合整理复杂的研究资料，并创建幻灯片演示文稿或播客等定制资源。您可以先利用随附的 Google AI Pro 六个月试用，探索面向 Galaxy Watch 和即将推出的智能眼镜的全新 Gemini 集成功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "975bb72cea8b815f",
      "translationZh": "来看看 Galaxy Unpacked 2026 活动上的这三项 Google 新更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66c024cb175ab7d5",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Intelligence 现在可以为你在超过 40 款热门应用中自动执行任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d35be76a055c1bb",
      "translationZh": "在你的折叠屏设备上使用 Gemini Notebook，研究和梳理复杂项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82ae5e010a124569",
      "translationZh": "通过全新的 Galaxy Watch 9，在腕间轻松使用 Gemini。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "569af63821c6dee9",
      "translationZh": "敬请期待今年秋季推出的智能眼镜，支持无需手持操作的手势控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d5f54d3f17f3d64",
      "translationZh": "Google 刚刚推出了新的 Samsung 手机，利用 AI 处理订餐或订票之类的枯燥琐事。你还可以使用一款名为 Gemini Notebook 的新工具，帮助你研究项目，并将笔记转化为测验或视频。此外，他们还将 AI 引入智能手表和眼镜，让你无需触碰手机就能获得帮助。这些更新都是为了让你的科技设备为你做更多事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d50c05c383b7dafb",
      "translationZh": "今天，在伦敦举行的 Galaxy Unpacked 活动上，我们庆祝了 Samsung Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra、Fold8 和 Flip8 的发布。借助这些设备，我们让上手 Android 变得前所未有地轻松，同时也开始推出 Gemini Intelligence 1 的首批功能——它承载着我们对技术主动为你服务的愿景。无论你选择展开手机，在更大的屏幕上尽可能提高工作效率，还是将手机保持折叠，以便专注于日常生活，Gemini Intelligence 都会助你处理繁重事务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "409392acfae15cfd",
      "translationZh": "下面来看看即将登陆最新设备的三项更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0d0e1f60b0552de3",
      "translationZh": "1. 借助 Gemini Intelligence，体验新一代任务自动化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ce525151d3090c8",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Intelligence 可以帮你分担数字杂务，让你少花些时间盯着屏幕。早在 2 月，我们就推出了任务自动化测试版，帮助你将简单的日常任务交给 Gemini，例如叫网约车，或点你最喜欢的外卖并配送到家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61cf9250b588e651",
      "translationZh": "如今，任务自动化支持的应用正从少数几款扩展到超过 40 款热门应用。2 这意味着，Gemini 现在可以帮助你处理更多日常“生活琐事”——从购物、预订晚餐餐位，到预订旅行体验和购买活动门票。在 Galaxy Z Flip8 上，你甚至可以通过长按电源键，直接从 Flex Window 获取这项帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28c21709791be206",
      "translationZh": "此外，Gemini 现在可以运用高级推理来理解屏幕上的内容，并将复杂图像作为提示进行解析。这能帮你高效起步——因为有时，说明需求最简单的方式，就是给 Gemini 看一份购物清单或一张灵感照片。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b948c2dc73d6a0a",
      "translationZh": "在 Gemini 执行任务期间，你可以在屏幕上逐步跟踪进度，在其他应用中同时处理事务，或者合上手机，让 Gemini 在后台运行。如果你需要快速调整或加入个人特色，可以介入处理某个具体细节，然后将控制权交还给 Gemini，让它完成剩余部分。Gemini 的设计是，在任务准备好供你审核并最终确认时通知你。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "75839faad8aa25f5",
      "translationZh": "2. 借助 Gemini Notebook，提升你的项目水准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46753187a45eac05",
      "translationZh": "为了帮助你管理需要深入投入的项目并综合梳理复杂信息，我们正将 Gemini Notebook（原名 NotebookLM）的强大功能直接带到你的设备上。这款应用已预装在 Samsung 的新款折叠屏设备上。3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "019dd6130f4da234",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Notebook 是你的思考与研究伙伴，由我们先进的多模态模型提供支持。在 Galaxy Z Fold8 系列的宽大屏幕上，你可以将照片、文档、白板图像、录音等内容直接拖放到并排布局的工作区中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "003fa35b09cb9a58",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 Gemini Notebook 中的聊天功能，就你的资料提问；也可以更进一步，创建符合你最佳学习方式的高质量定制资源，包括幻灯片演示文稿、视频、抽认卡、测验，甚至播客。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7645d84f89495ea",
      "translationZh": "为了帮助你应对最具挑战性的项目，我们为每一部 Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra、Fold8 和 Flip8 都附赠六个月的 Google AI Pro 试用，让你有更多机会使用 Audio Overviews、Video Overviews、Slides 等强大功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a2aba0b817389db9",
      "translationZh": "3. 通过手表和眼镜，随时随地使用 Gemini。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a9bc2ad03cf765a",
      "translationZh": "我们与 Samsung 的合作不止于智能手机。在 Galaxy Watch 9 上，你可以在出行时更便捷地使用 Gemini。只需抬起手腕，Gemini 就会激活，让你可以向它提问，无需唤醒词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efba75adfb87aa3f",
      "translationZh": "我们也将把 Gemini 带到眼镜上。在 Google I/O 2026 上，我们宣布了与 Samsung 合作打造、将于今年秋季推出的智能眼镜，并分享了合作伙伴眼镜品牌 Gentle Monster 和 Warby Parker 的两款设计。今天，我们又公布了两款镜框，并进一步介绍了 Gemini 将如何在这些新设备上发挥助益。例如，如果你佩戴了兼容的 Wear OS 手表，只需一个手势就能控制眼镜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "947d2869d5dd7cba",
      "translationZh": "无论你是想简化日常生活，还是提高工作效率，今天公布的内容都只是我们未来计划的开端。更多智能功能一旦准备就绪，我们就会陆续推出，不让你久等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中接收 Google 最新资讯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱以确认订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用一个 来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8638384806635fdd",
      "translationZh": "面向部分国家和语言的年满 18 岁用户提供。部分功能可在 Gemini app 上使用，功能可用性会有所不同。请核查回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f460125c32b96f8",
      "translationZh": "包括在美国和韩国受支持的应用。请密切监督，必要时中断。仅限部分应用、设备和市场。仅限年满 18 岁的用户。可在 Gemini app 上使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e2aba7001159146",
      "translationZh": "请核查回答的准确性。功能及其可用性因地区和年龄而异。部分设备附带为期 6 个月的 Google AI Pro 试用；除非取消，否则订阅将在试用结束后自动续订。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 新闻",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "960f40ea452ca40c",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Live 中的 Guided Vision：专为无障碍使用而打造",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dd4d30b785e1679",
      "translationZh": "作者：Isha Sheth 和 Scott Adams",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 获奖预告片《The Gifted》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "717d7c74d523f088",
      "translationZh": "Google Beam 拓展至新地区，迎来新合作伙伴和客户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f27cf251c837b106",
      "translationZh": "新一批互联应用正陆续向 Gemini 推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3070dbe5b762a2c7",
      "translationZh": "新专家加入 Google 的 AI 与经济团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64df1b9e4b2e1f94",
      "translationZh": "作者：Scott Strand 和 Zanna Iscenko",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
